	<<case "meek" "shy">>
		You place the <<= _sextoy>> on the counter with studied care, as though being gentle with it might make the conversation easier.
	<<case "docile">>
		You slide the <<= _sextoy>> across the counter toward Sydney and fold your hands in front of you, waiting for <<him>> to notice.
	<<case "polite" "flamboyant">>
		You set the <<= _sextoy>> on the counter with a small, composed smile.
	<<case "bratty" "confident">>
		You plunk the <<= _sextoy>> down on the counter in front of Sydney like a challenge.
	<<case "cruel">>
		You place the <<= _sextoy>> on the counter and leave it there without explanation, making Sydney be the one to break first.
	<<case "special">>
		You set the <<= _sextoy>> on the counter between you and Sydney, letting the silence do some of the work.
	<<default>>
		You place the <<= _sextoy>> on the counter.
<</switch>>
<<if _sydneyStatus.includes("corrupt")>>
	시드니의 눈썹이 올라가지만, <<he>>【이가】 놀란 것 같지는 않다. <<He>>【은는】 그것을 빛에 비춰보며 눈을 가늘게 뜬다. 지나가던 몇몇 학생들이 <<his>> 뻔뻔함에 입을 떡 벌린다.
	<br><br>

	<<if _sydneyChastity>>
		<<He>>【은는】 잠시 생각에 잠긴 듯하다가, 이내 고개를 젓는다.
		<br><br>

		"I'm already packing heat down there." <<He>> clunks the <<= _sextoy>> against <<his>> chastity belt. "It's a fun idea, though."
	<<else>>
		<<His>> face splits into a wide grin as <<he>> regards the <<= _sextoy>>.
		<br><br>

		"네가 물어봐 주기만을 기다렸어." <<he>>【이가】 말한다. <<He>>【은는】 그것을 <<his>> <<if $pronoun is "m">>바지<<else>>치마<</if>>에 찔러 넣는다. <<His>> 흥분이 손에 잡힐 듯하다.
		<<giftSexToys "Sydney">>
	<</if>>
<<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes("pure")>>
	Sydney blankly stares at it, until <<his>> eyes widen in realisation. <<He>> gasps, scrambling to shove the <<= _sextoy>> under the counter.
	<br><br>

	<<if _sydneyStatus.includes("Lust")>>
		<<He>>【은는】 손가락을 <<his>> 입술로 가져가며 눈을 동그랗게 뜬다. "저, 정말?" <<he>>【이가】 침을 꿀꺽 삼킨다. "그걸 내... 거기에 넣을 거라고—"
		<br>
		당신은 <<him>>의 말을 끊고 당신에게 사용해 달라는 뜻이라고 분명히 밝힌다. <<His>> 얼굴이 한층 더 붉어진다.
	<<else>>
		"이거... 내가 생각하는 그거 아니지...? 그렇지?" <<He>>【은는】 초조하게 침을 삼킨다. "그리고 네가 원하는 건 내가... 너한테...?"
		<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
			<<case "meek" "shy">>
				You duck your head and give a tiny, burning nod.
			<<case "docile">>
				You nod once, quietly, and keep your hands folded behind your back.
			<<case "polite" "flamboyant">>
				You nod with as much dignity as the situation allows.
			<<case "bratty" "confident">>
				You nod without hesitation, meeting <<his>> eyes the whole time.
			<<case "cruel">>
				You nod, expression flat, as if daring <<him>> to be the one embarrassed.
			<<case "special">>
				You nod with a faint smile, letting the implication hang there.
			<<default>>
				당신은 고개를 끄덕인다.
		<</switch>>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<if _sydneyChastity>>
		<<He>>【은는】 아래를 내려다보며 고개를 젓는다. "못할 것 같아... 내... 그거 때문에... 작동시키기가... 알잖아..." <<He>>【은는】 <<his>> 정조대를 손가락으로 톡톡 친다.
		<br><br>

		<<He>>【은는】 다시 <<his>> 일에 집중하며, 그 문제에 대해 더 이상 말하려 하지 않는다.
	<<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes("Lust")>>
		<<His>> 눈이 당신을 제외한 모든 곳을 보며 초조하게 두리번거린다. "음... <<nnpc_Mum "Sirris">> 님께서 시야를 넓혀야 한다고 하셨으니까." <<He>>【은는】 <<his>> 입술을 적신다. "네가 행복해진다면야..."
		<br><br>

		<<He>> takes the <<= _sextoy>> in trembling hands, shoving it to the bottom of <<his>> school bag. <<He>> doesn't stop glancing over <<his>> shoulder.
		<<giftSexToys "Sydney">>
	<<else>>
		<<He>> doesn't hesitate as <<he>> shoves the <<= _sextoy>> back into your hands, wiping <<his>> own on <<his>> <<if $pronoun is "m">>trousers<<else>>skirt<</if>>.
		<br><br>

		"I'm sorry, I can't. It's just too..." <<He>> trails off into a string of formless squeaks and mutters as <<he>> forces it back into your grip. "C-can you please put it away now? Someone might see..."
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	시드니는 숨을 헐떡이며 서둘러 그것을 <<his>> 무릎 위로 당겨 보이지 않게 숨긴다.
	"진심은 아니지?" <<he>>【이가】 속삭인다. "정말로 내가...?"
	<br><br>
	<<switch _speechAttitudeResolved>>
		<<case "meek" "shy">>
			당신은 얼굴을 붉히며 고개를 숙이고 끄덕인다.
		<<case "docile">>
			You nod and wait patiently for <<him>> to process it.
		<<case "polite" "flamboyant">>
			You nod with a small, encouraging smile.
		<<case "bratty" "confident">>
			You nod eagerly, as if the answer should be obvious.
		<<case "cruel">>
			You nod once, gaze unwavering.
		<<case "special">>
			You nod and let the tension between you do the rest.
		<<default>>
			당신은 고개를 끄덕인다.
	<</switch>>
	<br><br>

	<<if _sydneyChastity>>
		<<He>>【은는】 얼굴을 찌푸린 채 그것을 쳐다보다가, 이내 고개를 젓는다.
		<br><br>

		"미안하지만, 내가 좀... 거추장스러워서." <<He>>【은는】 <<his>> 정조대를 손마디로 톡톡 친다. "그래도 흥미로운 생각이네."
	<<elseif _sydneyStatus.includes("Lust")>>
		<<He>>【은는】 생각에 잠겨 그것을 쳐다본다. 마침내, <<he>>【이가】 중얼거린다. "내... 내가 새로운 걸 시도해 봐도 나쁠 건 없겠지."
		<br><br>

		<<He>> takes the <<= _sextoy>> and shoves it to the bottom of <<his>> school bag. <<He>> looks conflicted, but flashes you an uneasy smile all the same.
		<<giftSexToys "Sydney">>
	<<else>>
		<<He>>【은는】 <<his>> 입술을 깨물며, 장난감을 유심히 쳐다본다. 마침내, <<he>>【이가】 한숨을 쉰다.
		<br><br>

		"미안하지만... 안 돼. 지금은 안 돼." <<He>>【은는】 그것을 당신 손에 다시 쥐여주며, 옅은 미소를 짓는다. "내... 내가 생각해 볼게." <<His>> 말투는 설득력이 없지만, 당신은 일단 이 주제를 그만두기로 한다.
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
